cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PokéLab in research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "PokéLab"
abstract: >-
  PokéLab is a zero-runtime-dependency Python framework for reproducible Pokémon
  battle simulation, agent benchmarking, and policy research. It provides a
  deterministic singles engine, a zoo of baseline agents, seeded evaluation with
  confidence intervals and Bradley-Terry ratings, training utilities, and
  experiment tooling.
authors:
